          "_name": "article02",
          "_sourceTheme": "modelm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article02 modelm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description Line Color\" value=\"#d70081\" name=\"desc\" condition=\"showDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrapper\">\n                            <b>El Equipo</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">El corazón estratégico de NEVO.&nbsp;</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>A QUIÉN VA DIRIGIDO</b><br>Directores y gerentes de cualquier área que toman decisiones sobre transformación digital en sus organizaciones. No se requieren conocimientos técnicos.<br><br><b>EL EQUIPO</b><br><b>Dr. Giulio Toscani<br></b>Director académico · Senior Lecturer UPF-BSM PhD KTH Estocolmo · Especialización en IA, MIT Sloan &amp; CSAIL · Asesor de Telefónica, GE, Nike y PwC · Autor de AUGMENTED (Routledge, 2025).<br><br><b>Expertos de Needed</b> <br>Especialistas en evolución digital y liderazgo con experiencia directa en organizaciones mexicanas y latinoamericanas.<br><br><b>POR QUÉ NEEDED &amp; UPF-BSM</b><br>Dos perspectivas que se complementan: el conocimiento del mercado mexicano y latinoamericano de Needed, y el rigor académico internacional de la UPF Barcelona School of Management, segunda universidad española según Times Higher Education 2025.<br><br><b>INVERSIÓN Y CERTIFICACIÓN</b><b><br></b>$22,283.03 pesos mexicanos + IVA por participante.<br><br>Cupos limitados. Inicia el 26 de agosto.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            View Portfolio\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article02-6i",
