          "_name": "article02",
          "_sourceTheme": "modelm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article02 modelm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description Line Color\" value=\"#d70081\" name=\"desc\" condition=\"showDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrapper\">\n                            <b>Cronograma de Sesiones</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">El corazón estratégico de NEVO.&nbsp;</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>A QUIÉN VA DIRIGIDO</b><br>Directores y gerentes de cualquier área que toman decisiones sobre transformación digital en sus organizaciones. No se requieren conocimientos técnicos.<br><br><b>EL EQUIPO</b><br><b>Dr. Giulio Toscani<br></b>Director académico · Senior Lecturer UPF-BSM PhD KTH Estocolmo · Especialización en IA, MIT Sloan &amp; CSAIL · Asesor de Telefónica, GE, Nike y PwC · Autor de AUGMENTED (Routledge, 2025).<br><br><b>Expertos de Needed</b> <br>Especialistas en evolución digital y liderazgo con experiencia directa en organizaciones mexicanas y latinoamericanas.<br><br><b>POR QUÉ NEEDED &amp; UPF-BSM</b><br>Dos perspectivas que se complementan: el conocimiento del mercado mexicano y latinoamericano de Needed, y el rigor académico internacional de la UPF Barcelona School of Management, segunda universidad española según Times Higher Education 2025.<br><br><b>INVERSIÓN Y CERTIFICACIÓN</b><b><br></b>$22,283.03 pesos mexicanos + IVA por participante.<br><br>Cupos limitados. Inicia el 26 de agosto.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            View Portfolio\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article02-6k",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vjMLBm9sWz",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "steps1",
          "_sourceTheme": "marketm4",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".card": {
              "width": "100%"
            },
            "& when (@addBlockAmount = \"1\")": {
              ".card:nth-child(odd)": {
                ".add__block": {
                  "display": "none"
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@addBlockAmount = \"2\")": {
              ".card:nth-child(even)": {
                ".add__block": {
                  "display": "none"
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@addBlockAmount = \"4\")": {
              ".card": {
                ".add__block": {
                  "display": "none"
                }
              }
            },
            ".add__block": {
              "margin-top": "35px",
              ".add__block_image": {
                "width": "170px",
                "img": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "border-radius": "6px"
                }
              },
              ".add__block_content": {
                "margin-left": "30px",
                "max-width": "270px"
              },
              ".add__block_title": {
                "margin-bottom": "0"
              },
              ".add__block_text": {
                "margin-top": "15px",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "color": "#919dab"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "margin": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".step-container": {
              "margin-top": "25px"
            },
            ".padding__bot": {
              "padding-bottom": "50px"
            },
            ".step-text-content": {
              "padding-top": "10px"
            },
            ".mbr-step-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "font-weight": "500",
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".mbr-step-text": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "margin-top": "20px",
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "margin-top": "20px",
              ".btn": {
                "font-weight": "500"
              }
            },
            ".step": {
              "display": "flex",
              "width": "(@stepSize * 2px)",
              "height": "(@stepSize * 2px)",
              "font-size": "~\"calc((@{stepSize}px) - 2px)\"",
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "border": "2px solid @lineColor",
              "background-color": "@lineColor",
              "font-weight": "500",
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "& when (@stepSize > 24px)": {
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "width": "48px",
                  "height": "48px",
                  "font-size": "24px"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 400px)": {
              ".add__block": {
                "display": "flex"
              },
              ".step-element": {
                "display": "flex"
              },
              ".mbr-section-btn": {
                "margin-top": "20px",
                "margin-left": "~\"calc((@{stepSize} * 2px) + 70px)\"",
                ".btn": {
                  "margin-left": "0"
                }
              },
              ".separline": {
                "position": "relative",
                "&:after": {
                  "top": "(@stepSize * 2px)",
                  "left": "(@stepSize - 2px)",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "content": "\"\"",
                  "width": "2px",
                  "height": "~\"calc(100% - (@{stepSize}px) * 2)\"",
                  "background-color": "@lineColor",
                  "& when (@stepSize > 24px)": {
                    "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                      "top": "52px",
                      "left": "22px",
                      "height": "~\"calc(100% - 56px)\""
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".step-text-content": {
                "margin-left": "70px"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 400px)": {
              ".add__block_title": {
                "margin-top": "30px"
              },
              ".add__block": {
                ".add__block_content": {
                  "margin-left": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"steps1 marketm4_steps1\" group=\"Steps\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Step Title\" name=\"showStepTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Step Text\" name=\"showStepText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Line Color\" name=\"lineColor\" value=\"#d70081\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Steps Count\" name=\"stepsAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">6</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"7\">7</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Step Size\" name=\"stepSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"30\" step=\"1\" value=\"18\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Show Image\" name=\"addBlockAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">odd</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">even</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">all</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>none</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg1.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-3.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xl-10 col-lg-11\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\tCronograma sesiones:<br><br></h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-class=\"{'separline padding__bot': stepsAmount > '1'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-element\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"step align-items-center justify-content-center\" data-app-selector=\".step\">1</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-text-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-step-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-title\" mbr-if=\"showStepTitle\"><b>Sesión 1</b> -&nbsp;26 de agosto</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-step-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-text\" mbr-if=\"showStepText\"><b>Por qué la IA cambia las reglas del juego.&nbsp;<br></b>El nuevo panorama competitivo de la inteligencia artificial para ejecutivos. Casos: Spotify, Starbucks y Sephoraember Council on Foreign Relations.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-start add__block\" mbr-if=\"addBlockAmount\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/pasted-image-11-380x380.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"add__block_title ls2fw500 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".add__block_title\">JUAN ENRIQUEZ</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"add__block_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".add__block_text\">Managing Director at Excel Venture Management, LLC<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"stepsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'separline padding__bot': stepsAmount > '2'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-element\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"step align-items-center justify-content-center\" data-app-selector=\".step\">2</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-text-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-step-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-title\" mbr-if=\"showStepTitle\"><b>Sesión 2</b> -&nbsp;2 de septiembre</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-step-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-text\" mbr-if=\"showStepText\"><b>Dónde manda la máquina y dónde manda el humano.&nbsp;<br></b>Automatización, chatbots y asistentes virtuales aplicados al negocio. Ética y sesgo en IA. Casos: Pinterest y Adobe Sensei</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-start add__block\" mbr-if=\"addBlockAmount\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/brian-green-1-320x320.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"add__block_title ls2fw500 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".add__block_title\">Bernardo González</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"add__block_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".add__block_text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProfessor at Columbia Business School\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"stepsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'separline padding__bot': stepsAmount > '3'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-element\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"step align-items-center justify-content-center\" data-app-selector=\".step\">3</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-text-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-step-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-title\" mbr-if=\"showStepTitle\"><b>Sesión 3</b> -&nbsp;9 de septiembre</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-step-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-text\" mbr-if=\"showStepText\"><b>Del PowerPoint a la realidad.</b> <br>Implementación de IA en organizaciones: pilotos, KPIs y gestión del cambio. Caso: Netflix.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-start add__block\" mbr-if=\"addBlockAmount\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bernardo-gonzalez--560x560.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"add__block_title ls2fw500 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".add__block_title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBERNARDO GONZALEZ</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"add__block_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".add__block_text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDirector de Innovación, Kio Networks</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"stepsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'separline padding__bot': stepsAmount > '4'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-element\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"step align-items-center justify-content-center\" data-app-selector=\".step\">4</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-text-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-step-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-title\" mbr-if=\"showStepTitle\"><b>Sesión 4</b> - 16 de septiembre</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-step-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-step-text\" mbr-if=\"showStepText\"><b>Tu plan listo para el comité directivo.</b> <br>Sesión 100% práctica. Sales con un roadmap concreto de inteligencia artificial para tu organización.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-start add__block\" mbr-if=\"addBlockAmount\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/charlene-li-leadership-speaker-462x462.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"add__block_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"ad